  "description": "This policy setting determines which users and groups can change the time and date on the internal clock of the computers in your environment. Users who are assigned this user right can affect the appearance of event logs. When a computer's time setting ischanged, logged events reflect the new time, not the actual time that the events occurred.\n\nThe recommended state for this setting is: *S-1-5-32-544 and *S-1-5-19\n",
